This Terraform configuration will set up a blue/green deployment with AWS Elastic Beanstalk Environments, an RDS database, and manage the database snapshot process. The Elastic Beanstalk Environments will be associated with the RDS database, and a snapshot of the database named "my_db" will be taken prior to deployment. Additionally, an instance profile named "ec2_eb_profile1" will be created for EC2 instances launched by Elastic Beanstalk.

