}
```

This configuration creates a Route 53 zone for the domain `example.com`, an AAAA record for the zone that maps to the provided IPv6 address, and an A record that aliases to the AAAA record with health check evaluation enabled. It also creates an IAM role for Route 53 to assume and a health check for the AAAA record. The default IPv6 address is set to `2001:0db8:85a3:0000:0000:8a2e:0370:7334`.

