}

output "kendra_index_id" {
  value = aws_kendra_index.kendra_index.id
}
```

This configuration creates an AWS Kendra domain, an index within that domain, a proxy configuration for the domain, and outputs the IDs of the domain and index for further use. The proxy configuration uses HTTP_1_1 protocol version and port 80, and sets up a CNAME configuration for the proxy.

