    geographic_locations = ["ASIA_PACIFIC"]
    priority             = 3
  }
}
```

This configuration creates an Active-Active failover policy by using Route 53 Traffic Policy, Route Policy, Geolocation Config, and Health Check resources. The primary and secondary health checks are created using the provided FQDNs. The zone is named "main". The configuration also includes IAM roles as they are required by the AWS provider.

