Replace the `subnet-xxxxxxxx`, `subnet-yyyyyyyy`, and `subnet-zzzzzzzz` with the IDs of your subnets in the specified region.

This configuration uses the AWS provider version `~> 5.75` and Terraform version `~> 1.9.8`. It creates an IAM role for the MSK service and attaches the `AmazonMSKFullAccess` policy to it. The MSK cluster is created with three broker nodes, each running on an `m5.large` instance type. The cluster is configured to use the specified subnets and VPC, and it uses encryption in transit and at rest.

