This Terraform configuration will create two Amazon S3 buckets: one for storing objects and another for storing weekly CSV inventory reports of all current object versions in the first bucket. The configuration includes IAM roles for Terraform and the AWS Lambda function that will be used to generate the CSV reports.

Terraform HCL:

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-west-2"
}

locals {
  inventory_bucket_name = "s3-inventory-bucket-${random_id.id.hex}"
  bucket_name           = "s3-bucket-${random_id.id.hex}"
}

