 Description: This Terraform configuration will create an Amazon S3 Glacier vault for long-term data archiving in the specified AWS region. The vault will be encrypted at rest using a customer-managed key (CMK) and will have a default retention period of 10 years.

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-west-2"
}

locals {
  glacier_vault_name = "my-long-term-data-archiving-vault"
  glacier_vault_kms_key_arn = "arn:aws:kms:us-west-2:123456789012:key/01234567-89ab-cdef-0123-456789abcdef"
