 Description: This Terraform configuration will create an Amazon Web Services (AWS) Application Load Balancer (ALB) with an IP Target Group. The ALB will be configured with a listener that forwards traffic on port 80 to the target group.

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-west-2"
}

locals {
  lb_name = "my-alb"
  tg_name = "${local.lb_name}-tg"
}

resource "aws_vpc" "main" {
  cidr_block = "10.0.0.0/16"
}

