This configuration creates an AWS VPC, subnets, security group, key pair, launch configuration, autoscaling group, ALB, target group, and listener for both HTTP and HTTPS protocols. The ALB is configured to forward traffic to the target group, which contains the EC2 instances launched from the autoscaling group. The ACM certificate ARN should be replaced with your own certificate ARN.

